{"id":"856834e1c94138dc","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence.md","title":"统一可计算连续函数列的可和 L¹ 变差收敛","display":"thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence — 统一可计算连续函数列的可和 L¹ 变差收敛","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence","aliases":["43-thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence"],"display":"thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence — 统一可计算连续函数列的可和 L¹ 变差收敛","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-thm-ml-integral-test]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence — 统一可计算连续函数列的可和 L¹ 变差收敛"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"afddf8e62e2b3b86\" href=\"?note=afddf8e62e2b3b86\" title=\"43-thm-ml-integral-test\">43-thm-ml-integral-test</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(\\mathbb R^{2^\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(f=(f_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(\\mathbb R^{2^\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。假设存在全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(m:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathbb N^2\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(q:\\mathbb N^2\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}(m)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall Y\\in2^\\omega\\;|q(n,k,Y\\upharpoonright m(n,k))-f_n(Y)|\\le2^{-k},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Computable}(m)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall Y\\in2^\\omega\\;|q(n,k,Y\\upharpoonright m(n,k))-f_n(Y)|\\le2^{-k},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中可计算性与编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 与非负 Lebesgue 积分采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a> 的正式定义；明列积分定义域条件及可和变差条件：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}(|f_{n+1}-f_n|),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}(|f_{n+1}-f_n|),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\int_{2^\\omega}|f_{n+1}-f_n|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\int_{2^\\omega}|f_{n+1}-f_n|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists L\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}f_n(X)=L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists L\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}f_n(X)=L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 t(Y)=∑ₙ|fₙ₊₁(Y)−fₙ(Y)|。统一计算的连续函数列使 t 下半可计算，非负积分的单调收敛给出积分有限。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"afddf8e62e2b3b86\" href=\"?note=afddf8e62e2b3b86\" title=\"43-thm-ml-integral-test\">43-thm-ml-integral-test</a> 推出 t(X)&lt;∞，故 fₙ(X) 是实数 Cauchy 列并有有限极限。</p>\n<p>改用描述数学内容的文件名，删除旧标识中未经支持的作者归属。本结论及附件中的本地证明保留；不增加变差和必须有可计算收敛模的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-ml-integral-test","status":"resolved","id":"afddf8e62e2b3b86","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-integral-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(\\mathbb R^{2^\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}$，$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。假设存在全函数 $m:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$、$q:\\mathbb N^2\\times2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q$ 满足","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"其中可计算性与编码见 [[43-df-computable]]。$\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}$ 与非负 Lebesgue 积分采用 [[43-df-measure]] 的正式定义；明列积分定义域条件及可和变差条件：","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"其中可计算性与编码见 [[43-df-computable]]。$\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}$ 与非负 Lebesgue 积分采用 [[43-df-measure]] 的正式定义；明列积分定义域条件及可和变差条件：","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$ 满足 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 的 $\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-ml-integral-test","status":"resolved","id":"afddf8e62e2b3b86","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"令 t(Y)=∑ₙ|fₙ₊₁(Y)−fₙ(Y)|。统一计算的连续函数列使 t 下半可计算，非负积分的单调收敛给出积分有限。[[43-thm-ml-integral-test]] 推出 t(X)<∞，故 fₙ(X) 是实数 Cauchy 列并有有限极限。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f=(f_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(\\mathbb R^{2^\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"m:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathbb N^2\\times2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computable}(m)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(q)\\land\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall Y\\in2^\\omega\\;|q(n,k,Y\\upharpoonright m(n,k))-f_n(Y)|\\le2^{-k},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{NonnegativeMeasurable}_{2^\\omega,\\mathcal B}(|f_{n+1}-f_n|),","display":true},{"tex":"\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\int_{2^\\omega}|f_{n+1}-f_n|\\,d\\mu<\\infty.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists L\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}f_n(X)=L.","display":true}],"bytes":2256,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-computable-l1-variation-convergence]] — 可计算L¹变差收敛"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","0586e0fd0301d605","f357216a7edb035a","8e999d59227f4a28","afddf8e62e2b3b86"]}